  <artifactId>application-with-workflow-module-config-in-a-jar</artifactId>
  <name>Quarkus integration - Integration test application whose configuration is in a JAR</name>
  <!-- A workflow module which ships nothing but its descriptor, its BPMN resource and its
       configuration, in every location and every format the config source providers read.
       It is the normal shape of a workflow module packaged as its own Maven module, and the
       shape a native image has to carry the files of: a file inside a dependency JAR is not
       part of an image unless the extension named it. -->
</project>
